  "content": "\n\n<center><a href=\"https://discord.gg/CpWXamx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img title=\"source: imgur.com\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WlrSbJp.png\" /></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://paypal.me/gottschsmods?country.x=US&locale.x=en_US\"><img title=\"source: imgur.com\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/se1ERhJ.png\" /></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/hz/wishlist/ls/31YQP9T4H9NI7?ref_=wl_share\"><img title=\"source: imgur.com\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EcaUQMi.png\" /></a></center>\n</br>\n\n<center><b>这是一个必需的基础库（API），我的大多数其他模组都依赖它。</b></center>\n</br>\n\n<p><strong>目前使用此库的一些模组：</strong></p>\n<p>Treasure2</p>\n<p>Legacy Vault</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Protect It</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Dungeon Denizens</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Enemy Echelons</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Dungeons2</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Fast Ladder</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Metals</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">文件名格式：[<strong>模组名称</strong>]-<strong>mc</strong>[Minecraft版本]-<strong>f</strong>[Forge版本]-<strong>v</strong>[模组版本].jar</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">例如：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><a class=\"overflow-tip twitch-link\" href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/gottschcore/files/2517954\" data-action=\"file-link\" data-id=\"272450\" data-name=\"GottschCore-mc1.12-f14.21.1.2387-v1.2.0.jar\">GottschCore-mc1.12-f14.21.1.2387-v1.2.0.jar</a></span></p>",
